-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">明明已经</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">感觉像是回忆了（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我来总结一下</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这次的E3吧！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">《宝可梦 太阳·月亮》</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">实机游玩！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/001-89983b3aed.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/001-89983b3aed.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1122\" height=\"600\"></a></figure>\n\nNintendo Treehouse Live\n北美有超过31万人\nNico直播也有超过7万人\n观看了节目！\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/002-60c3cba858.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/002-60c3cba858.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还不知道接下来球球海狮会被打倒（笑）\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/003-1d977d1444.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/003-1d977d1444.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n多亏了芭瓢虫努力战斗\n大家才能看到\n利利小镇的祭典！\n好险啊（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n强颚鸡母虫\n只希望它能在下周六的玩具展上\n登场了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后晚上是\n宝可梦交响进化\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/004-b01af23a68.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/004-b01af23a68.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n各位管弦乐团成员\n演奏得太棒了！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/005-7b599e265e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/005-7b599e265e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"957\" height=\"782\"></a></figure>\n\n因为正式演出结束后没能和我打招呼\n还特地来到酒店找我的Jeron！\n一直谢谢你啦！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n第二天\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦 GO开发者问答\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/006-2fcffe156e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/006-2fcffe156e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n明明是日本时间凌晨2点\n还是有将近2万人观看了节目！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/007-2fdd27fafb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/007-2fdd27fafb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n这张照片相当豪华吧！\n\n<br>\n\n最左边的主持人比尔，听说也负责过《Screw Breaker》的\n本地化工作！\n\n左起第二位的Aaron先生是2013年WCS的冠军！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后是最后一天的\n\n《宝可梦特别节目》\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/008-310ab92715.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/008-310ab92715.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n等待正式演出的增田\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/009-23d1d34d40.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/009-23d1d34d40.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n一边阅读大家的评论\n一边等待的增田\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n正式演出转眼间就结束了（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/010-a716f759f1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/010-a716f759f1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n                        结束后的合影！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/011-f238fcf932.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/011-f238fcf932.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n林先生\n谢谢你！\n\n\n\n\n                藤原，辛苦啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/012-889adfa7e9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/012-889adfa7e9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n就这样\nE3上的发表活动结束了！\n\n<br>\n\n如果大家哪怕能享受到一点\n我也会很开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ただいまー！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回のE3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ニコ生での放送3本！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">いかがでしたか？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">深夜にも関わらず</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">多くの方に見ていただけたようで</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ありがとうございました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">すでに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">思い出みたいになってますが（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回のE3を</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">まとめてみました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">「ポケットモンスター サン・ムーン」</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">実機プレイ！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/001-89983b3aed.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/001-89983b3aed.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1122\" height=\"600\"></a></figure>\n\nNintendo Treehouse Live\n北米では31万人以上\nニコ生は7万人以上の方に\n見て頂きました！\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/002-60c3cba858.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/002-60c3cba858.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nこの後アシマリがやられる事を\nまだ知らない（笑）\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/003-1d977d1444.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/003-1d977d1444.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nレディバが頑張ってくれたお陰で\nリリィタウンのお祭りを\n見てもらう事が出来ました！\n危なーい（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nアゴジムシは\n来週土曜日のホビーフェアで\n出る事を祈るばかり（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして夜は\nPokémon Symphonic Evolutions \n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/004-b01af23a68.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/004-b01af23a68.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nオーケストラのみなさん\n最高の演奏でした！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/005-7b599e265e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/005-7b599e265e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"957\" height=\"782\"></a></figure>\n\n本番終了後に挨拶できなかったからと\nホテルにまで来てくれたJeron!\nいつもありがとうね！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n翌日\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nPokémon GO developer Q&amp;A\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/006-2fcffe156e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/006-2fcffe156e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n日本深夜2時なのに約2万人もの方に\n見て頂きました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/007-2fdd27fafb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/007-2fdd27fafb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nこの写真かなーり豪華だよね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n1番左の司会のビルはスクリューブレイカーの\n\nローカライズもやってくれたらしい！\n\n左から2番目のAaronさんはWCS2013のチャンピオン！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして最終日の\n\n「ポケモンスペシャル」\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/008-310ab92715.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/008-310ab92715.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n本番を待つマスダ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/009-23d1d34d40.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/009-23d1d34d40.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nみんなのコメントを読みながら\n待つマスダ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n本番はあっと言う間（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/010-a716f759f1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/010-a716f759f1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n                        終了後の記念撮影！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/011-f238fcf932.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/011-f238fcf932.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n林さん\nありがとうございました！\n\n\n\n\n                藤原くんお疲れ様でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/012-889adfa7e9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4261374/012-889adfa7e9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nこうして\nE3での発表は終わりました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n少しでも楽しんでもらえたなら\n嬉しいです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}